{"unit_id":"zkb-1271__dsh-pet-whale#card-zh","repo":"zkb-1271/dsh-pet-whale","commit":"6c6f3d3ac517b278708d7c0a2a663a25a6e02f12","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pet-whale 是一款适用于 DSH 网页客户端的像素蓝鲸桌宠插件。它在设置页提供宠物配置，并将鲸鱼和通知托盘加入页面；在支持的 macOS 环境还可启用桌面悬浮窗。鲸鱼根据会话运行、等待处理、失败或完成切换动画，并可在提醒中打开会话、停止任务、处理审批或回答问题。它还支持自定义宠物、位置和大小调整、漫游与自动巡航，以及摸头、跳跃和喷水互动。适合希望通过轻量视觉提示跟踪 DSH 任务、并在页面或桌面获得陪伴反馈的用户。无需配置 API 密钥；桌面悬浮需使用 DSH 自带的 Electron 运行时。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2632-2674","lib/index.js:424-443","lib/index.js:236-238"]}
{"unit_id":"zkb-1271__dsh-pet-whale#card-en","repo":"zkb-1271/dsh-pet-whale","commit":"6c6f3d3ac517b278708d7c0a2a663a25a6e02f12","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pet-whale adds a pixel whale and task alerts to DSH. Animations reflect running, waiting, failed and completed sessions. Alerts can open sessions, stop tasks, handle approvals and answer questions. It also supports custom pets and roaming. A desktop overlay uses DSH’s Electron runtime on macOS.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:2632-2674","lib/index.js:424-443","lib/index.js:236-238"]}
